### Transactions API — request collection
### Run the requests top to bottom; @accessToken and @refreshToken fill themselves in.

@host = http://localhost:8080
@email = alice@example.com
@password = Str0ng!Pass
@recipientEmail = bob@example.com



### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Health with dependencies
GET {{host}}/health/dependencies

### Prometheus metrics
GET {{host}}/actuator/prometheus


### Register
# @name register
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alice Silva",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "phone": "+5511999999999"
}

### Register the transfer recipient
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bob Souza",
  "email": "{{recipientEmail}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

@accessToken = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
@refreshToken = {{login.response.body.refreshToken}}

### Balance
GET {{host}}/transactions/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Deposit
POST {{host}}/transactions/deposit
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 10000 }

### Withdraw
POST {{host}}/transactions/withdraw
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 2500 }

### Transfer
POST {{host}}/transactions/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipientEmail": "{{recipientEmail}}",
  "amount": 1500
}

### List all transactions
GET {{host}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### List with filters (type is lowercase; dates are ISO-8601)
GET {{host}}/transactions?type=transfer&from=2026-01-01T00:00:00&to=2030-01-01T00:00:00
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Profile
GET {{host}}/user/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Update profile
PATCH {{host}}/user/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Alice Renamed" }

### Rotate the token pair
POST {{host}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}" }

### Logout (revokes the refresh token and blacklists the access token)
POST {{host}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}" }

### Deactivate account
DELETE {{host}}/user/account
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Reactivate account
POST {{host}}/auth/reactivate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}
